# onnxruntime-node (through @huggingface/transformers and kokoro-js) downloads its CUDA add-on from
# github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime when it installs on Linux x64. Nothing here uses CUDA, and on 2026-11-18
# that repository answered 404, which failed every fresh Linux install (CI included). The CPU binaries
# ship inside the npm package. Yarn hands this key to the install script as npm_config_*.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
